        198.1304168701172,
        179.674560546875
      ],
      "text": "Other considerations",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        185.1600341796875,
        513.4376220703125,
        198.51153564453125
      ],
      "text": "The recommendations that relate to infection control do not specifically mention children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        201.15655517578125,
        250.11036682128906,
        214.508056640625
      ],
      "text": "but are relevant to all TB patients.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        225.66302490234375,
        513.4375610351562,
        239.0145263671875
      ],
      "text": "The Panel noted that the recommendations are related to health service strengthening",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        241.6595458984375,
        513.4144897460938,
        255.01104736328125
      ],
      "text": "and implementation of activities at various levels of the health service, and that the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        257.65606689453125,
        489.9429626464844,
        271.007568359375
      ],
      "text": "principles of infection control outlined in this document are all relevant to children.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        282.16253662109375,
        513.4144897460938,
        295.5140380859375
      ],
      "text": "The Panel recognized that there are certain facility-based settings, for example neonatal",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        298.1590576171875,
        342.54742431640625,
        311.51055908203125
      ],
      "text": "care settings, where the risk for children is very high.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        322.3895568847656,
        161.72140502929688,
        336.0170593261719
      ],
      "text": "Panel decision",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        341.5025634765625,
        345.7558898925781,
        354.85406494140625
      ],
      "text": "No recommendations specific to children were made.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
